  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Exponential growth and its inverse, the logarithm, appear throughout the mathematics section.",
          "ar": "يظهر النمو الأسي وعكسه، اللوغاريتم، في جميع أنحاء قسم الرياضيات."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Exp & logs",
          "ar": "▲ مرجع — الأسس واللوغاريتمات"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\( \\log_b x=y \\) means \\( b^{y}=x \\); \\( \\log(xy)=\\log x+\\log y \\); \\( \\log(x^{n})=n\\log x \\); \\( \\ln e=1 \\).",
          "ar": "\\( \\log_b x=y \\) تعني \\( b^{y}=x \\)؛ \\( \\log(xy)=\\log x+\\log y \\)؛ \\( \\log(x^{n})=n\\log x \\)؛ \\( \\ln e=1 \\)."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "figure",
        "caption": {
          "en": "Figure 1: Graphs of inverse pair y = 2^x and y = log₂(x) reflected across line y = x",
          "ar": "شكل 1: التمثيل البياني للدالتين العكسيتين y = 2^x و y = log₂(x) وانعكاسهما حول المستقيم y = x"
        },
        "figure": {
          "type": "fn",
          "title": "Exponential and Logarithmic Inverses",
          "fns": [
            {
              "fn": "2^x",
              "label": "y = 2^x",
              "color": "#1E3A6E"
            }
          ],
          "xrange": [
            -3,
            4
          ],
          "yrange": [
            -2,
            8
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Definition",
              "ar": "التعريف"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( b^{y}=x \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Product",
              "ar": "الضرب"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\log x+\\log y \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Power",
              "ar": "القوة"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( n\\log x \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Natural",
              "ar": "الطبيعي"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\ln e=1 \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 8.A",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 8.أ"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Evaluate \\( \\log_2 16 \\). \\[ 2^{4}=16\\Rightarrow 4. \\]",
          "ar": "احسب \\( \\log_2 16 \\). \\[ 2^{4}=16\\Rightarrow 4. \\]"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "⚠️ Tahsili Exam Traps — Logarithm Properties & Negative Arguments",
          "ar": "⚠️ أفخاخ اختبار التحصيلي — خواص اللوغاريتمات والمدخلات السالبة"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p><strong>Logarithm argument must be strictly positive:</strong> \\(\\log_b(x)\\) is only defined for \\(x > 0\\) and \\(b > 0, b \\neq 1\\). Expressions like \\(\\log_2(-4)\\) or \\(\\log_2(0)\\) are undefined.</p><p><strong>Common logarithmic laws misconception:</strong> \\(\\log(A + B) \\neq \\log A + \\log B\\)! The product rule is \\(\\log(A \\cdot B) = \\log A + \\log B\\).</p>",
          "ar": "<p><strong>ما بداخل اللوغاريتم يجب أن يكون موجباً تماماً:</strong> \\(\\log_b(x)\\) معرّف فقط لـ \\(x > 0\\) و \\(b > 0, b \\neq 1\\). المقادير مثل \\(\\log_2(-4)\\) غير معرّفة.</p><p><strong>خطأ شائع في قوانين اللوغاريتمات:</strong> \\(\\log(A + B) \\neq \\log A + \\log B\\)! القانون الصحيح لحاصل الضرب هو \\(\\log(A \\cdot B) = \\log A + \\log B\\).</p>"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "id": "tah-explog-p1",
        "question": {
          "en": "Solve for \\(x\\): \\[ 3^{2x - 1} = 27 \\]",
          "ar": "أوجد قيمة \\(x\\) في المعادلة الأسية: \\[ 3^{2x - 1} = 27 \\]"
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "Base 3 equality: \\(27 = 3^3 \\implies 2x - 1 = 3 \\implies 2x = 4 \\implies x = 2\\).",
          "ar": "توحيد الأساس 3: \\(27 = 3^3 \\implies 2x - 1 = 3 \\implies 2x = 4 \\implies x = 2\\)."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "id": "tah-explog-p2",
        "question": {
          "en": "Find the value of: \\[ \\log_2(32) - \\log_3(81) \\]",
          "ar": "احسب قيمة المقدار: \\[ \\log_2(32) - \\log_3(81) \\]"
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "Evaluate logarithms: \\(\\log_2(32) = 5\\) and \\(\\log_3(81) = 4\\). Subtract: \\(5 - 4 = 1\\).",
          "ar": "حساب اللوغاريتمين: \\(\\log_2(32) = 5\\) و\\(\\log_3(81) = 4\\). الطرح: \\(5 - 4 = 1\\)."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
